{"version":1,"id":"olivia-rodrigo-the-grudge","title":"The Grudge","artist":"Olivia Rodrigo","key":"G","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/olivia-rodrigo/the-grudge/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Daniel Leonard Nigro and Olivia Isabel Rodrigo","chords":[{"symbol":"A#","canonical":"A#","keyboardPitchClasses":[10,2,5],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"A#/A","canonical":"A#/A","keyboardPitchClasses":[],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Gm","canonical":"Gm","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,10,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D#","canonical":"D#","keyboardPitchClasses":[3,7,10],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Cm","canonical":"Cm","keyboardPitchClasses":[0,3,7],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F","canonical":"F","keyboardPitchClasses":[5,9,0],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"instrumental","text":"[Intro]","columns":16,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#/A","column":12,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"instrumental","text":"","columns":16,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#/A","column":12,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"section","text":"[Primeira Parte]","columns":16,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"I have nightmares each week 'bout that Friday in May","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#/A","column":40,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"One phone call from you and my entire world was changed","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#/A","column":34,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Trust that you betrayed, confusion that still lingers","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"Took everything I loved and crushed it in between your fingers","columns":62,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"And I doubt you ever think about the damage that you did","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#/A","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"But I hold onto every detail like my life depends on it","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#/A","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"My undying love, now I hold it like a grudge","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"Now I hear your voice every time that I think I'm not enough","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"And I try to be tough, but I wanna scream","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"How could anybody do the things you did so easily?","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"And I say I don't care, I say that I'm fine","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"But you know I can't let it go, I've tried, I've tried, I've tried for so long","columns":78,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":71,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"It takes strength to forgive, but I don't feel strong","columns":53,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":36,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D#","column":46,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"section","text":"[Segunda Parte]","columns":15,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"The arguments that I've won against you in my head","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#/A","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"In the shower, in the car, and in the mirror before bed","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#/A","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"Yeah, I'm so tough when I'm alone, and I make you feel so guilty","columns":64,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"And I fantasize about a time you're a little fuckin' sorry","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"And I try to understand why you would do this all to me","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#/A","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"You must be insecure, you must be so unhappy","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#/A","column":35,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"And I know, in my heart, hurt people, hurt people","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"And we both drew blood,","columns":23,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":7,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"But, man, those cuts were never equal","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"And I try to be tough, but I wanna scream","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"How could anybody do the things you did so easily?","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"And I say I don't care, I say that I'm fine","columns":43,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"But you know I can't let it go, I've tried, I've tried, I've tried for so long","columns":78,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":71,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"It takes strength to forgive, but I don't feel strong","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":24,"beat":1},{"symbol":"D#","column":34,"beat":2},{"symbol":"A#","column":48,"beat":3}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"section","text":"[Ponte]","columns":7,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"Ooh, ooh-ooh, do you think I deserved it all?","columns":45,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":21,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D#","column":31,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"Ooh, ooh-ooh, your flower's filled with vitriol","columns":47,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":19,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D#","column":40,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":"You built me up to watch me fall","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-38","kind":"lyric","text":"You have everything, and you still want more","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-39","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-40","kind":"lyric","text":"I try to be tough, I try to be mean","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":2,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-41","kind":"lyric","text":"But even after all this, you're still everything to me","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-42","kind":"lyric","text":"And I know you don't care, I guess that that's fine","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-43","kind":"lyric","text":"But you know I can't let it go, I've tried, I've tried, I've tried for so long","columns":78,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Cm","column":72,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-44","kind":"lyric","text":"It takes strength to forgive, but I'm not quite sure I'm there yet","columns":66,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":24,"beat":1},{"symbol":"D#","column":42,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":58,"beat":3}]},{"id":"line-45","kind":"lyric","text":"It takes strength to forgive, but","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":24,"beat":1},{"symbol":"D#","column":35,"beat":2},{"symbol":"A#","column":39,"beat":3}]}]}